<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰμαρτ-άνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι </span>(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Acut. (Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>):—<i>miss the mark, fail,</i> c.
			part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. παίοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.1.16
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>miss one's aim,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				95
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατορθοῦν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>err, do wrong,</i> abs., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1039
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πᾶσι κοινόν ἐστι τοὐξ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1024
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				15.1D.
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ ποιεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				25.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.108
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς οἰκέτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					2.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					945
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.110
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				9.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span> in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				336e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὰ μέγιστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.7.33
				</span></i>
			: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. διατρίβων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.3.56
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τι</span>
			<i>commit</i> a <i>fault,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1012
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be mismanaged, to be a failure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐξαμαρτανομένη πρᾶξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					357d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξημαρτήθη τὰ νοσήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					4.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεῖαι ἐξημαρτημέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1289b9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> trans.,
				<i>cause to sin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				15.26
			</span></i>,al.</div>
